| --- | --- |
| Profile | ${PROFILE_ID} |
| Model | ${MODEL} |
| Served model name | ${SERVED_MODEL_NAME} |
| vLLM image | ${VLLM_IMAGE} |
| Dtype | ${SERVING_DTYPE} |
| KV cache dtype | ${kv_cache_dtype_display} |
| Calculate KV scales | ${calculate_kv_scales_display} |
| Tensor parallel size | ${tensor_parallel_size_display} |
| Node profile | $(display_optional_metric "${SERVING_NODE_PROFILE:-}") |
| Max model length | ${MAX_MODEL_LEN} |
| GPU memory utilization | ${GPU_MEMORY_UTILIZATION} |
| Max sequences | ${max_num_seqs_display} |
| Max batched tokens | ${max_num_batched_tokens_display} |
| Cost scope | ${cost_scope_display} |
| Serving hourly cost | ${serving_hourly_cost_display} |
| Cost source | ${cost_source_display} |
| Region | ${cost_region_display} |
| Instance type | ${cost_instance_type_display} |
| Instance hourly cost | ${cost_instance_hourly_display} |
