${stream_shape_summary_section}

## Notes

- This report records the workload and serving contract for the selected case.
- Unavailable fields remain \`n/a\` when the runner did not collect that signal;
  do not treat missing GPU, queue, scaling, or cost fields as measured evidence.
- Client timing fields use k6 HTTP phases; client waiting is time to first byte,
  not a dedicated server-side queue histogram.
- Server timing fields use vLLM Prometheus histograms when the active vLLM image
  exposes them; missing queue, prefill, decode, TTFT, or inter-token histograms
  remain \`n/a\`.
- KV cache fields use vLLM Prometheus metrics when available; block counts,
  evictions, and reloads remain \`n/a\` unless directly observed or explicitly
  derived.
EOF
